// Kotlin compiles for Java 1.8 by default, while Spring Boot 4 and Vaadin 25 need
// Java 17+, hence `-jvm-target 21` in `kotlincOptions`. Kotlin classes are final
// by default, and Spring subclasses the `@SpringBootApplication` class, so it is
// declared `open`; the `kotlin-spring` compiler plugin would do the same for all
// Spring-annotated classes.

